I ran `git blame` on every tracked file except `LICENSE` and `HISTORY.md`. I used `-w -C` and `--ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs`. I did this because commit `62628c0` ("reformat js with 4-space indent and double quotes") touched nearly every line. Plain blame credits 1,018 lines to "Fiona Formatter" and understates everyone else. With that commit ignored, the counts show who wrote the code:

