- 10 of 45 people committed in the last 365 days. They hold 51.8% of the non-blank lines. The other 48.2% belong to people with no recent commit, mainly Douglas (33.1%) and Íñigo (4.8%).
- The bus factor is 2 (the fewest authors who together hold 50% of the lines): Troy and Douglas. It is 5 to reach 80%.
