- "Active" is measured as of 2026-04-12, the date the tool used. Today is 2026-10-24, so someone counted as active may have gone quiet since.
- Troy appears under two emails, `<email redacted>` and `troy@laptop.example`. The tool strongly suspects they are the same person, but I haven't merged them. If they are, Troy holds 649 lines, 39.0%.
- I left out one bot, `dependabot[bot]`, which has 10 lines and 11 commits.
- The history starts with a 2013-01-30 import covering 42% of the files. The table describes work since then.

